payload.text:
我將還原 `GroupCard` 的佈局，取消右側獨立的操作欄位，將「上移、下移、編輯」按鈕放回標題列的右上方，與展開圖示整合在一起。這樣可以讓卡片整體視覺更統一，同時透過 Flexbox 排版確保文字不會與按鈕重疊。

# Updated files:

## components/GroupCard.tsx

移除右側獨立操作欄 (Sidebar)，將操作按鈕群組移回卡片標題區域的右上方。

```tsx
import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { ArrowUp, ArrowDown, Pencil, ChevronUp, ChevronDown, CalendarHeart, Crown, Heart, Users } from 'lucide-react';
import { Group, Member } from '../types';
import { MemberGrid } from './MemberGrid';

interface GroupCardProps {
  group: Group;
  isFirst: boolean;
  isLast: boolean;
  onMove: (dir: number) => void;
  onEdit: () => void;
  onToggleExpand: () => void;
  onToggleRank: (member: Member) => void;
  onRemove: () => void;
}

export const GroupCard: React.FC<GroupCardProps> = ({ 
  group, isFirst, isLast, onMove, onEdit, onToggleExpand, onToggleRank, onRemove 
}) => {
  const biasMembers = group.members.filter(m => m.rank === 1);
  const ultMembers = group.members.filter(m => m.rank === 2);
  const [imageError, setImageError] = useState(false);

  // Reset error state when url changes
  useEffect(() => {
    setImageError(false);
  }, [group.logoUrl]);

  return (
    <div className="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 overflow-hidden animate-pop-in h-full flex flex-col w-full hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-200">
      {/* Header */}
      <div className="p-3.5 flex items-start select-none relative cursor-pointer flex-1 gap-3" onClick={onToggleExpand}>

        {/* Logo */}
        <div className="flex-shrink-0 pt-0.5">
           {group.logoUrl && !imageError ? (
             <img 
               src={group.logoUrl} 
               alt={group.name} 
               className="w-11 h-11 rounded-full object-cover border border-slate-100 shadow-sm"
               onError={() => setImageError(true)}
             />
           ) : (
             <div className="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-300 border border-slate-100">
                <Users className="w-5 h-5" />
             </div>
           )}
        </div>

        {/* Content Area */}
        <div className="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            {/* Title Row: Title + Actions */}
            <div className="flex justify-between items-start gap-2">

                {/* Title & Date */}
                <div className="min-w-0 flex-1">
                  <h2 className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 leading-snug break-words">
                    {group.name}
                  </h2>

                  {group.stanDate && (
                    <div className="text-[11px] text-violet-500 font-medium flex items-center gap-1 mt-0.5">
                      <CalendarHeart className="w-3 h-3 flex-shrink-0" /> <span className="truncate">Since {group.stanDate}</span>
                    </div>
                  )}
                </div>

                {/* Actions (Restored to Top Right) */}
                <div className="flex items-center gap-1 flex-shrink-0 -mt-1 -mr-1" onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}>
                    <button 
                      onClick={() => onMove(-1)} 
                      disabled={isFirst} 
                      className="p-1.5 text-slate-300 hover:text-violet-600 disabled:opacity-0 transition"
                      title="Move Up"
                    >
                      <ArrowUp className="w-4 h-4" />
                    </button>
                    <button 
                      onClick={() => onMove(1)} 
                      disabled={isLast} 
                      className="p-1.5 text-slate-300 hover:text-violet-600 disabled:opacity-0 transition"
                      title="Move Down"
                    >
                      <ArrowDown className="w-4 h-4" />
                    </button>
                    <button 
                      onClick={onEdit} 
                      className="p-1.5 text-slate-300 hover:text-violet-600 hover:bg-violet-50 rounded-full transition"
                      title="Edit"
                    >
                      <Pencil className="w-4 h-4" />
                    </button>
                    <div className="p-1.5 text-slate-300">
                       {group.isExpanded ? <ChevronUp className="w-4 h-4" /> : <ChevronDown className="w-4 h-4" />}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {/* Tags Row */}
            <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-1 min-h-[18px]">
              {ultMembers.map(m => (
                <span key={m.name} className="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 text-[11px] font-bold rounded-full border border-amber-200 max-w-full">
                  <Crown className="w-3 h-3 fill-current flex-shrink-0" /> <span className="truncate">{m.name}</span>
                </span>
              ))}
              {biasMembers.length > 0 && (
                <span className="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 text-[11px] font-bold rounded-full border border-rose-200">
                  <Heart className="w-3 h-3 fill-current" /> {biasMembers.length}
                </span>
              )}
              {ultMembers.length === 0 && biasMembers.length === 0 && (
                <span className="text-[11px] text-slate-400 py-0.5">
                  {group.members.length} Members
                </span>
              )}
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Grid */}
      {group.isExpanded && (
        <MemberGrid 
          group={group} 
          onToggleRank={onToggleRank} 
          onRemoveGroup={onRemove}
        />
      )}
    </div>
  );
};

這確實是個問題。原因在於我們為了防止「點擊操作按鈕時觸發卡片展開/收合」，在右上角的按鈕區塊加上了 `e.stopPropagation()` (停止事件冒泡)。

然而，展開箭頭圖示（Chevron）也被放在這個區塊內，而且它原本只是一個單純的 `<div>`，沒有綁定任何點擊事件。這導致點擊箭頭時，事件被攔截了，但沒有任何功能被執行。

我將修正 `GroupCard.tsx`，把展開箭頭改為一個帶有 `onClick={onToggleExpand}` 的按鈕，這樣點擊箭頭就能正常運作了。

# Updated files:

## components/GroupCard.tsx

將右上角的展開箭頭圖示從純 `div` 改為 `<button>` 並綁定展開事件，解決點擊無反應的問題。

```tsx
// ...
                    <button 
                       onClick={onToggleExpand}
                       className="p-1.5 text-slate-300 hover:text-violet-600 rounded-full transition"
                       title={group.isExpanded ? "Collapse" : "Expand"}
                       aria-label={group.isExpanded ? "Collapse" : "Expand"}
                    >
                       {group.isExpanded ? <ChevronUp className="w-4 h-4" /> : <ChevronDown className="w-4 h-4" />}
                    </button>
// ...

為了達成您的需求，我將進行以下更新：

1.  **資料結構 (`types.ts`)**：新增 `GroupDetails` 介面，並將其加入 `Group` 物件中，用來儲存這 6 項非必填的詳細資訊。
2.  **新元件 (`components/GroupDetailsModal.tsx`)**：建立一個專用的彈窗，讓使用者檢視與編輯這些入坑詳細資料。
3.  **卡片更新 (`components/GroupCard.tsx`)**：在卡片右上角新增一個「筆記本」圖示按鈕，點擊後開啟詳情彈窗。
4.  **主程式 (`App.tsx`)**：串接資料流與狀態管理，並更新資料匯入/匯出的處理邏輯。

以下是程式碼變更：

# Updated files:

## types.ts

新增 `GroupDetails` 介面與 `Group` 的 `details` 欄位。

```typescript
export interface Member {
  name: string;
  cn: string;
  rank: number; // 0 = None, 1 = Bias (Heart), 2 = Ult (Crown)
}

export interface GroupDetails {
  reason?: string;      // 入坑契機
  visual?: string;      // 最Get的颜
  favShip?: string;     // 最嗑的CP
  leastShip?: string;   // 最雷的CP
  favSubUnit?: string;  // 最喜欢的小分队
  topSong?: string;     // 仙曲TOP1
}

export interface Group {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  stanDate: string;
  isExpanded: boolean;
  members: Member[];
  logoUrl?: string;
  details?: GroupDetails; // New field
}

export interface PresetData {
  n?: string; // Name
  m?: string[][]; // Members [Name, CN]
  ref?: string; // Reference to another key
  l?: string; // Logo URL
}

export type PresetDB = Record<string, PresetData>;

export type ToastType = 'success' | 'error';
```

## components/GroupDetailsModal.tsx

新增此檔案，用於顯示與編輯團體詳細資料。

```tsx
import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { Save, Music, HeartHandshake, Sparkles, Frown, Users, BookOpen } from 'lucide-react';
import { Modal } from './ui/Modal';
import { Group, GroupDetails } from '../types';

interface GroupDetailsModalProps {
  isOpen: boolean;
  onClose: () => void;
  group: Group | null;
  onSave: (groupId: string, details: GroupDetails) => void;
}

export const GroupDetailsModal: React.FC<GroupDetailsModalProps> = ({ isOpen, onClose, group, onSave }) => {
  const [details, setDetails] = useState<GroupDetails>({});

  useEffect(() => {
    if (group && isOpen) {
      setDetails(group.details || {});
    }
  }, [group, isOpen]);

  const handleChange = (key: keyof GroupDetails, value: string) => {
    setDetails(prev => ({ ...prev, [key]: value }));
  };

  const handleSave = () => {
    if (group) {
      onSave(group.id, details);
      onClose();
    }
  };

  // Helper for input fields
  const renderInput = (
    key: keyof GroupDetails, 
    label: string, 
    icon: React.ReactNode, 
    placeholder: string,
    isTextArea: boolean = false
  ) => (
    <div className="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm transition-colors focus-within:border-violet-300 focus-within:ring-4 focus-within:ring-violet-50">
      <label className="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5">
        {icon} {label}
      </label>
      {isTextArea ? (
        <textarea
          value={details[key] || ''}
          onChange={(e) => handleChange(key, e.target.value)}
          className="w-full text-sm bg-transparent outline-none resize-none placeholder-slate-300 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed"
          placeholder={placeholder}
          rows={3}
        />
      ) : (
        <input
          type="text"
          value={details[key] || ''}
          onChange={(e) => handleChange(key, e.target.value)}
          className="w-full text-sm bg-transparent outline-none placeholder-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-medium"
          placeholder={placeholder}
        />
      )}
    </div>
  );

  return (
    <Modal isOpen={isOpen} onClose={onClose} title={`關於 ${group?.name || '團體'} 的詳細筆記`}>
      <div className="p-4 overflow-y-auto flex-1 bg-slate-50 space-y-3">

        {renderInput('reason', '入坑契機', <BookOpen className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-violet-500" />, '描述你是如何入坑的...', true)}

        <div className="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3">
            {renderInput('topSong', '仙曲 TOP 1', <Music className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-500" />, '這團必聽的一首歌')}
            {renderInput('visual', '最 Get 的顏', <Sparkles className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-500" />, '你的視覺 Pick')}
            {renderInput('favSubUnit', '最喜歡的小分隊', <Users className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-500" />, '最愛的小分隊組合')}
        </div>

        <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            {renderInput('favShip', '最嗑的 CP', <HeartHandshake className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-pink-500" />, '本命 CP')}
            {renderInput('leastShip', '最雷的 CP', <Frown className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400" />, '不吃的 CP')}
        </div>

      </div>
      <div className="p-3 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white rounded-b-2xl">
        <button 
          onClick={handleSave} 
          className="w-full bg-violet-600 text-white py-3 rounded-xl font-bold active:scale-95 transition shadow-lg shadow-violet-200 hover:bg-violet-700 flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <Save className="w-4 h-4" /> 儲存筆記
        </button>
      </div>
    </Modal>
  );
};
```

